{"ts": "2026-06-15T05:04:54+00:00", "note": "Wrote docs/lamp.md \u2014 comprehensive technical spec for the Jinn package system 'lamp'. Covers: 4 package tiers (std/libjn/ext/community) with new curated 'ext' vendored tier to enforce one-canonical-package-per-facet; project.jn manifest v2 (Jinn-native, declarative, no install scripts); MVS resolver + content-addressed jinn.lock v2 (content hash/sig/caps/deps); Nix-style content-addressed store + canonical deterministic archives; .jnlib binary library format (interface.jhi HIR slice + MIR + object + debug variant; source/binary/binary-debug flavors); full supply-chain layer (capability/effect manifest verified by compiler, Ed25519 signing + TOFU, provenance/SLSA, SBOM, transparency log, typosquat/dep-confusion defenses, no postinstall by construction); reproducible builds; federated/decentralized registry protocol (lamp serve, git bridge, P2P-ready); maintainer surface (in-repo signed bugs/changelog/notes, lamp release/yank); unified 'lamp' verb set replacing jinnc pkg subcommands; prior-art audit (Cargo/Go/npm/Nix/Deno/Maven/Sigstore/Elm); 12-phase impl roadmap mapping to src/pkg.rs, src/lock.rs, src/cache.rs, cmd_pkg.rs. This is the DESIGN deliverable; implementation is future work (phases 1-12)."}
